ng Polachan, also known as Poly, a wealthy planter\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000010\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":150,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aQ7tTufi63s\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004807\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006212\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006657\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008199\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009547\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013899\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014079\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019260\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019261\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019262\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000020\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"8414f07a-2d0c-45a8-aa1a-56419f8e4c1d\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00009042\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010196\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"TTT Entertainment\"},{\"id\":\"HO00009072\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Invite\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Joe and Angela’s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic \\nupstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. \\nHave they reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down?\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Joe and Angela’s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic \\nupstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"very strong language, strong sex references, drug misuse\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-03\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":106,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7YIHRhRMn94\",\"displayPriority\":8,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000785\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004368\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019329\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019330\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000241\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001028\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001154\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002297\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a87bd21e-c69e-4d0b-b7d0-18dabf2eeb9f\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00009072\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010230\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Black Bear Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00009089\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Dear You (Teochew with CH/EN subtitles)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"For years, Grandma Shurou from Chaoshan lived on the letters and remittances from her husband who left for Nanyang to survive the war and never returned. When her debt-ridden grandson Xiaowei secretly travels to Thailand to find his rumoured “millionaire” grandpa, he returns with shocking news: his grandpa is long gone, and the person Grandma had exchanged letters with for years was a stranger. As Xiaowei digs deeper, a long-buried misunderstanding spanning three generations begins to unravel, revealing a truth that binds two families across borders and time.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"For years, Grandma Shurou from Chaoshan lived on the letters and remittances from her husband who left for Nanyang to survive the war and never returned.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":118,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qIjOCYltUqA\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019352\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019353\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019354\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019356\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019357\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019358\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"fdea5aba-8ee5-45d5-9962-39c2b5f62b31\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00009089\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010248\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Trinity Filmed Entertainment\"},{\"id\":\"HO00009094\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Call of My Life\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The Call of My Life follows Soluchi, a 31-year-old call centre agent recovering from the wounds of a neglectful relationship. When a chance phone call introduces her to the kind and attentive Eli, she finds herself drawn to the possibility of love again. But to embrace the happiness she deserves, Soluchi must overcome her fear of rejection and learn to open her heart once more. A tender story of healing, vulnerability, and second chances.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The Call of My Life follows Soluchi, a 31-year-old call centre agent recovering from the wounds of a neglectful relationship. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-10\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015330\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019371\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019372\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019373